    "semantics": "Default and scan exit 0 after a completed scan even when findings exist; ci/verify exit 1 at policy threshold. Usage is 2, scan failure 3, verification failure 4, verified SAFE application 5, withheld mutation 6, and required-provider unavailability 7. UNKNOWN never means secure."
